      "Orchestration as metaphor \u2014 every layout, motif, and typographic choice encodes disparate parts resolved into one coherent system.",
      "Editorial restraint \u2014 spacious layouts, measured type scales, ink-and-paper contrast; no visual noise.",
      "Signal economy \u2014 indigo is a signal colour, never a flood; a single focal dot carries the accent.",
