    "signatureElements": [
      "Dot-dome \u2014 the primary mark: a polar lattice of dots forming an orchestra dome with one indigo focal dot at the podium; the rising-ensemble signature.",
      "Concentric dot-field \u2014 rings of dots radiating from a single indigo focal; full-bleed texture for heroes and dividers; drives the field-breathe motion.",
